 2 Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51786"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f476ab84e608463288081a57a35831c1496dc86cbc6442c7b05a2b87d3655d9f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9ec8e1a180502e0cbd3d8ca36eb21e1ab5905065809626ebf77723fcccf14224.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c51791","characterName":"中田 修一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c51791"},"originalCharacterName":"中田 修一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character is lost, feeling isolated and unloved in the world. This has molded him into an apathetic youth. He wants another person to fill his void, by force. He must own them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ben Woodhouse's Sensei 2 Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51791"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a966f0295a1c7207e67fb93f32e630491f96a76ded9ea0584c83416af4aa6361.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c55b7449a01aeff38dd3ce72152533c3cba40f1e87d62ec1b3eb910842718171.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c51832","characterName":"中田修一の祖父","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c51832"},"originalCharacterName":"中田修一の祖父","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nakata Shuichi's Grandfather is never named during the course of the story. He only makes an appearance in the beginning and is featured only in one of the routes as a side-character. He is the main head of the Nakata family and as such he wields considerable political power in Japan which will be of help to Shuichi at some point."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51832"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/5653319758e702d926abdb76ad3b68f6e69aed5c57758679c65c260ec3ff5ffc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a42cb3f6f0588ff2246a562092d5ec7bd6e56c244a896936696567e48a1c267c.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c51833","characterName":"友則 礒谷","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c51833"},"originalCharacterName":"友則 礒谷","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tomonori Isotani is a world history teacher at Yamigaura High School. He looks down on Shuichi and at one point will even beat him up for no apparent reason. That will be the crucial point when Shuichi will discover himself."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51833"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/462cb5ce72510cf3c785eae85ed5ed4198c641ea501b0102d945a35468806e4e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/18fc4f6a64850acd6f5deefbe3a5bf866d7191adac7f541ba0c1a84f03667174.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c51834","characterName":"伊東 美久","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c51834"},"originalCharacterName":"伊東 美久","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miku is a daughter of Kyouno. Because of the circumstances behind her birth she has never met her father and has only her mother for support. She is also the only thing her mother really cares about which will become exploitable by Shuichi if he decides to chase after Kyouno."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51834"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e20e9581ede5527ea7d87df182a08db786c119b13e44ff02a019f9accb363669.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/90d75c8fcfefe050be5aa722ca2ea560e73ec2fe9ac309d59a262a88d14d4530.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c51841","characterName":"鮫島 義人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c51841"},"originalCharacterName":"鮫島 義人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Samejima Yoshito is Samejima Tadashi's uncle. They both belong to a wealthy prestigious family. But Yoshito has a very dark secret from his past, when he was still the class president in high school. A certain tape will prove to be his undoing."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51841"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b775bf36f3473dbbff3db53425c5ecbdedc35787dd85b24c9ddac8c5d759dd6c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98717f2c10cbd7a5ba420a05e5f8cabf49e36e4d07bfb2fd01756c75e2edbe85.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c51843","characterName":"鮫島 只史","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c51843"},"originalCharacterName":"鮫島 只史","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Samejima Tadashi is Samejima Yoshito's nephew. They both belong to a wealthy prestigious family. But Tadashi has a dark secret. He likes to stalk little girls and coincidentally or not his latest target was none other than Itou Miku, the only daughter of Itou Kyouno. Will Miku be saved from the clutches of this maniac? We'll have to wait and see."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51843"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/38496766bac1523718717e83b5ad69450a41883e4a3e5146b5cc434266969f17.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b141c01b7bdaeee8a72a344aca27d93948dbc0786dc1197d42b3987ed9060d9.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p19","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:190","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p19","name":"D.O.(ディーオー)","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:395:190","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p19","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p19","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p19","name":"株式会社ディーオー","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:18886:v143","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1342","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1342","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1342","name":"Macho Studio","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus